Cell["\<\
compiled must be the complete Association returned by \
CompileCyclotomicMatrices. All blocks have the same coordinate dimension and \
exact field context.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"180136a6-15af-4401-b5a8-6f6a9435da65"],

Cell["\<\
The result stores the common basis by columns in \"basis_matrix\" and by rows \
in \"nullspace_rows\". iteration_nullities begins with the coordinate \
dimension and records the remaining nullity after each input block.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c30eaf2f-5a71-49be-95d8-e86d91c7bbbd"],

Cell["\<\
The method is the production iterative common-kernel algorithm. Every block \
is checked against the final exact basis. If any step or residual check \
fails, the function returns Failure; it never stacks all blocks as an \
automatic fallback and never uses floating point or SVD.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"b8b1f221-2fab-459b-836d-552d204676c8"]
}, Closed]],

