Cell["\<\
With no constraint blocks, every coordinate is free. The row basis is the \
identity and iteration_nullities contains only the initial dimension:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"4bb85e2a-2904-4337-b82d-e92c5cc530d1"],

