Cell["\<\
A problem with coordinate dimension zero has rank and nullity zero and \
retains a 0 by 0 basis matrix:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"25864e69-4d86-4272-aca4-1b66c371785f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"zeroCompiled", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"CompileCyclotomicMatrices", "[", 
    RowBox[{"<|", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\"\<coordinate_dimension\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "0"}], ",", 
      "\n", "  ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<constraints\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}]}], "\n", "|>"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"zeroResult", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"CyclotomicCommonKernel", "[", "zeroCompiled", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"{", "\n", "  ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"KeyTake", "[", 
    RowBox[{"zeroResult", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<iteration_nullities\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<rank\>\"", ",", 
       " ", "\"\<nullity\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"KeyTake", "[", "\n", "    ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"RestoreCyclotomicExpression", "[", 
      RowBox[{"zeroResult", "[", "\"\<basis_matrix\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
     "\n", "    ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<rows\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<columns\>\"", ",", 
       " ", "\"\<entries\>\""}], "}"}]}], "\n", "  ", "]"}]}], "\n", 
  "}"}]}], "Input",
 CellProlog:>Needs["MagneticTB`"],
 CellLabel->"In[3]:=",ExpressionUUID->"a1fbf511-6015-4f84-99b0-4d584da116e1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"\<\"iteration_nullities\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
      RowBox[{"{", "0", "}"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"rank\"\>", "\[Rule]", "0"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"nullity\"\>", "\[Rule]", "0"}]}], "\[RightAssociation]"}], ",", 
